OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1785782911
OL,3,CSchool worker 'not returning to role'
OL,4,Cafter speech at protest
OL,6,FA learning support assistant "will not
OL,7,Fbe returning to work" - according to
OL,8,Fher Somerset school - after she took
OL,9,Fpart in a rally in Taunton organised
OL,10,Fby the Somerset Patriots.
OL,12,FIn footage circulated on social media,
OL,13,FBrenda Heal can be heard making a
OL,14,Fspeech about the increasing number of
OL,15,F"black and Asian children" attending
OL,16,FCrispin School in Street, Somerset,
OL,17,Fwhere she was a member of staff.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
