FL,408,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1785782911
OL,3,CSchool worker 'not returning to role'
OL,4,Cafter speech at protest
OL,6,FIn the video, she says: "I work in a
OL,7,Fschool and there's 1,100 kids. Up
OL,8,Funtil 18 months ago, we only had
OL,9,Fbetween three and four in any thousand
OL,10,Fblack or Asian children.
OL,12,F"We have now anywhere between 25 and
OL,13,F80 (students) in 18 months in a small
OL,14,Ftown called Street".
OL,16,FShe tells those at the rally not to
OL,17,F"listen to the nonsense" and asked
OL,18,Fpeople to "stand and fight".
OL,20,FFootage credited to @lil doza on X
OL,26,@uD@DpmuD@Mpn|D@Ypo
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
