PN,40703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1785782911
OL,3,CSchool worker 'not returning to role'
OL,4,Cafter speech at protest
OL,6,FThe Wessex Learning Trust, which
OL,7,Fincludes the Crispin School Academy,
OL,8,Fconfirmed the learning support
OL,9,Fassistant would not be returning to
OL,10,Fwork in September.
OL,12,FIn a statement the trust said: "We
OL,13,Fwould like to make clear that the
OL,14,Fviews expressed do not represent the
OL,15,Fviews of the Wessex Learning Trust or
OL,16,FCrispin School.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,408,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1785782911
OL,3,CSchool worker 'not returning to role'
OL,4,Cafter speech at protest
OL,6,F"We are proud to serve a diverse and
OL,7,Finclusive community, and we firmly
OL,8,Fbelieve that the diversity of our
OL,9,Fpupils, staff and wider community is
OL,10,Fone of the school's and Trust's
OL,11,Fgreatest strengths.
OL,13,F"We are committed to ensuring that
OL,14,Feveryone is treated with dignity,
OL,15,Frespect and fairness, regardless of
OL,16,Ftheir race, religion, ethnicity or
OL,17,Fbackground.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,408,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1785782911
OL,3,CSchool worker 'not returning to role'
OL,4,Cafter speech at protest
OL,6,F"We would like to thank those members
OL,7,Fof our community who have taken the
OL,8,Ftime to bring this material to our
OL,9,Fattention.
OL,11,F"We can confirm that the member of
OL,12,Fstaff will not be returning to work at
OL,13,FCrispin School or the Wessex Learning
OL,14,FTrust in September. Due to
OL,15,Fconfidentiality, we are unable to
OL,16,Fcomment further on matters relating to
OL,17,Findividual members of staff.
OL,19,F"May we reassure you that we have
OL,20,Ffollowed internal processes and sought
OL,21,Fguidance from the relevant authorities.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
