FL,408,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1785782911
OL,3,CSchool worker 'not returning to role'
OL,4,Cafter speech at protest
OL,6,F"The Wessex Learning Trust and Crispin
OL,7,FSchool will continue to work with
OL,8,Forganisations that promote the
OL,9,Feducation of cultural diversity for
OL,10,Fthe benefit or our learners, staff and
OL,11,Fcommunity."
OL,13,FITV News has attempted to reach out to
OL,14,FMs Heal for comment.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/6
